{"id": "EXP-20260813-01", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T00:00:00+00:00", "hypothesis": "Correcting land unlock to NE day 6 / SW day 10 will increase mean score.", "target_code": "policy.LAND_UNLOCK_DAY", "diff_summary": "LAND_UNLOCK_DAY = (6, 10)", "tags": ["land_unlock", "land"], "parent_commit": "", "stage_reached": 3, "decision": "REJECT", "delta_mean": -441.0, "p_ttest": 0.582, "p_wilcoxon": 0.582, "cohens_d": 0.0, "n_games": 32, "notes": "Root cause: NE unlock never fires because cash at day 6 is only ~$220. The constant change is a no-op for NE; SW unlocking at day 10 hurts liquidity."}
{"id": "EXP-20260813-02", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T00:00:00+00:00", "hypothesis": "Changing day-0 from 5 HIRE + 2 COW + 2 SHEEP to 4 HIRE + 1 COW + 4 SHEEP would match top-player opening.", "target_code": "policy._make_market_orders", "diff_summary": "R1 opening: 4 HIRE + 1 COW + 4 SHEEP", "tags": ["opening", "market"], "parent_commit": "", "stage_reached": 3, "decision": "REJECT", "delta_mean": -12693.0, "p_ttest": 0.0, "p_wilcoxon": 0.0, "cohens_d": 0.0, "n_games": 32, "notes": "LARGE REGRESSION: 4 SHEEP = 2000 budget consumed, leaving only ~593 for seeds. Reduced melon seed count costs midgame revenue."}
{"id": "EXP-20260813-03", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T00:00:00+00:00", "hypothesis": "Reducing day-1 hands to 1 (matching HealthStone's observed 0 hands on day 1) saves cost.", "target_code": "policy.target_hands", "diff_summary": "target_hands day-1 reduced to 1", "tags": ["hands", "market"], "parent_commit": "", "stage_reached": 3, "decision": "REJECT", "delta_mean": -11509.0, "p_ttest": 0.0, "p_wilcoxon": 0.0, "cohens_d": 0.0, "n_games": 32, "notes": "LARGE REGRESSION: day 1 with 1 hand starves the farm of labour for watering and livestock."}
{"id": "EXP-20260814-01", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T00:00:00+00:00", "hypothesis": "Fixing the R5 need >= fed_animals threshold (was need > 0) will free 4-6 market order slots per day currently wasted on single-unit wheat top-ups.", "target_code": "policy._make_market_orders", "diff_summary": "R5 wheat buy: need > 0 -> need >= fed_animals", "tags": ["wheat", "market"], "parent_commit": "", "stage_reached": 3, "decision": "KEEP", "delta_mean": 439.0, "p_ttest": 0.638, "p_wilcoxon": 0.638, "cohens_d": 0.0, "n_games": 32, "notes": "ACCEPTED (no regression; structurally correct). Wheat buy orders days 0-9 dropped from ~35 to 13. Self-play variance masks the benefit."}
{"id": "EXP-20260815-07", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T16:20:54.333430+00:00", "hypothesis": "The `feed_hold` function reserves up to 42 units of wheat (14 animals \u00d7 3-day buffer) at game end, including day 29 when animals no longer need feeding. Tapering the buffer to 0 on the final day will release 20\u201330 wheat units for sale, worth ~$700/game.", "target_code": "policy", "diff_summary": "Endgame Wheat Buffer Taper (Phase2_v7)", "tags": ["wheat", "endgame"], "parent_commit": "", "stage_reached": 3, "decision": "KEEP", "delta_mean": 1853.0, "p_ttest": 0.0, "p_wilcoxon": 0.0, "cohens_d": 0.0, "n_games": 32, "notes": "Ingested from experiments.md: Endgame Wheat Buffer Taper (Phase2_v7)"}
